sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser (SPA + MSAL)
  participant E as Microsoft Entra ID
  participant A as SmartServe.Api
  Note over B: auth.ts builds PublicClientApplication<br/>authority login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant}<br/>cache: sessionStorage
  U->>B: Open portal
  B->>B: getAllAccounts()
  alt Account already cached in session
    B->>E: acquireTokenSilent(scope = VITE_API_SCOPE)
    E-->>B: Access token (JWT)
    B->>A: GET /api/requests + Authorization: Bearer
    A->>E: Fetch signing keys / metadata (Microsoft.Identity.Web)
    A->>A: Validate issuer, audience, signature, lifetime
    A-->>B: 200 OK
  else No account (sign-in UI not implemented)
    B->>A: GET /api/requests (no Authorization header)
    A-->>B: 401 Unauthorized
    B-->>U: Error shown in alert box
  end
  Note over B,E: Gap: no loginRedirect/loginPopup call exists in src/frontend
